<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish Life 1996 pre-tax profit 153 mln punts.</title>
<headline>Irish Life 1996 pre-tax profit 153 mln punts.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Embedded value earnings  97.4		   vs 95.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	   8.5		    vs 7.75</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   12.05		  vs 11.0</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	     153.0		  vs 56.42</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name - Irish Life Plc is a life assurance and investment company.</p>
<p>Embedded value earnings measure the future value of policies sold during the year, the value of existing business and increases in shareholders' investment.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
